# Paste your Steam cookie header string here (single line).
# Example:
# steamLoginSecure=76561198XXXXXXXXX%7C%7CXXXXXXXX...; sessionid=XXXXXXXX
#
# How to get it:
# 1. Open https://steamcommunity.com/market/ in Chrome/Firefox while logged in
# 2. Open DevTools -> Network -> reload the page
# 3. Click any request to steamcommunity.com
# 4. Under Request Headers, copy the entire "Cookie:" value
# 5. Save as server/cookies.txt (not this .example file)
